!! Noun inflection
!  ---------------
!! The Ume Sami language nouns inflect in number and cases.

LEXICON Cases
 +Sg+Nom:0   #     ;
 +Sg+Acc:at  #     ;
 +Sg+Loc:asne  #     ;
 +Pl+Nom:t   #     ;
 +Pl+Acc:i #     ;
 +Pl+Loc:isne #     ;
         #:0   Nouns ; ! Normally going via a R lexicon adding compound tags.

! vim: set ft=xfst-lexc:

